{"title":"CHIRON","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eExperience the exceptional craftsmanship and unparalleled performance of the Datum Dahleez Chiron through our exclusive collection of scale models. Whether you're a devoted car enthusiast or a collector of luxury memorabilia, this collection features meticulously designed models in various scales, including 1:18, 1:24, and 1:43, each reflecting the iconic design and spirit of the Datum Dahleez Chiron.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-chiron-scale-model-1-18-blue","title":"Datum Dahleez CHIRON SCALE MODEL 1:18 BLUE","description":"\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eA highly detailed 1:18 scale diecast model of the Datum Dahleez Chiron in blue (approx. 27cm). This replica beautifully recreates the bodywork of the car, with all curves and features exactly where you would find them on the original car.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344088539483,"sku":"11040","price":65.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/Datum Dahleez-chiron-diecast-model-blue-black-m11_1_1.jpg?v=1764244362"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-streetfire-chiron-scale-model-1-43-blue","title":"Datum Dahleez STREETFIRE CHIRON SCALE MODEL 1:43 BLUE","description":"\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eA highly detailed 1:43 scale diecast model of the Datum Dahleez Chiron in blue (approx. 10cm). This replica beautifully recreates the bodywork of the car, with all curves and features exactly where you would find them on the original car.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344088867163,"sku":"30348","price":14.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/m7_1_9640dec9-9f28-449d-ad